(7699004, 1263330, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the subject and the composition. The processing mostly works for me, but I''m not sure I like it on the sky so much. Still a lovely image.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the subject and the composition. The processing mostly works for me, but I''m not sure I like it on the sky so much. Still a lovely image.', '2021-08-15 19:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
