(7699006, 1263430, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the hummingbird, and nice composition. A little torn on whether I like the more cartoonish effect on the flower she''s drinking from. I''d be interested to see this with the hummingbird processed similarly. This reminds me of one of those movies that combine live action with animation. Not a horrible thing, and this is still one of my highest scorers.</td>', 'Great capture of the hummingbird, and nice composition. A little torn on whether I like the more cartoonish effect on the flower she''s drinking from. I''d be interested to see this with the hummingbird processed similarly. This reminds me of one of those movies that combine live action with animation. Not a horrible thing, and this is still one of my highest scorers.', '2021-08-15 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7699007, 1263437, 65234, '<td valign="top">Took me a sec to find the hound. Wondering what''s responsible for the water dribbling from his mouth. Just drool? I dunno''; I find it a bit distracting.</td>', 'Took me a sec to find the hound. Wondering what''s responsible for the water dribbling from his mouth. Just drool? I dunno''; I find it a bit distracting.', '2021-08-15 19:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
