(7699383, 1263111, 67145, '<td valign="top">another stunner from the master .. <br/>this is such a brilliant image ... <br/>totally gave me the goose bumps when i opened it .. <br/>many congratulations on the blue ... :)<br/> <br/>i wrote that bit above and had another look before i closed it . <br/>another thing that comes to mind is relevant to the covid restrictions .. especially where i live .. as you know they''ve extended our lockdown for another four weeks . that''ll be three months . <br/>seeing this image brings to mind the alone-ness of so many ppl at this time .. the one solitary person in amongst all the buildings and man-made edifices .. the impersonal feeling those steel structures give me .. intensifies that feeling of alone-ness .. <br/>whether you meant it or not .. what i see .. is irrelevant .. its the sort of image that ppl can look at and take away what is meaningful for them .. <br/>so good Anita .. so good . :)</td>', 'another stunner from the master .. this is such a brilliant image ... totally gave me the goose bumps when i opened it .. many congratulations on the blue ... :) i wrote that bit above and had another look before i closed it . another thing that comes to mind is relevant to the covid restrictions .. especially where i live .. as you know they''ve extended our lockdown for another four weeks . that''ll be three months . seeing this image brings to mind the alone-ness of so many ppl at this time .. the one solitary person in amongst all the buildings and man-made edifices .. the impersonal feeling those steel structures give me .. intensifies that feeling of alone-ness .. whether you meant it or not .. what i see .. is irrelevant .. its the sort of image that ppl can look at and take away what is meaningful for them .. so good Anita .. so good . :)', '2021-08-22 01:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
