(7699386, 1263456, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely LOVE this Johanna .. you are truly a master when it comes to photographing ppl and their pets .. your images always bring me into their world .. so wonderfully ... i am in awe of your photographic prowess and your excellent imagination .. and i know that you have to really have a connection to a deeper part of yourself to get the results you do in your photography .. <br/>many congratulations on the ribbon .. i love seeing this on the home page . :)</td>', 'absolutely LOVE this Johanna .. you are truly a master when it comes to photographing ppl and their pets .. your images always bring me into their world .. so wonderfully ... i am in awe of your photographic prowess and your excellent imagination .. and i know that you have to really have a connection to a deeper part of yourself to get the results you do in your photography .. many congratulations on the ribbon .. i love seeing this on the home page . :)', '2021-08-22 01:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
