(7699389, 1263484, 67145, '<td valign="top">oh haha .. where i live there is a pacific highway too .. have travelled on it thousands of times .. suppose there are a heap of roads and highways named the same in different countries . but it took me aback initially when i saw Pacific Highway in your comment .. <br/>its a fantastic point of view you have achieved with your drone .. and i''m loving the mist or low lying clouds .. they really add to the appeal of this image ..   congratulations on fourth place  .. you are such an all round photographer .. nothing seems to be a challenge for you .. unintentional pun there . ;)</td>', 'oh haha .. where i live there is a pacific highway too .. have travelled on it thousands of times .. suppose there are a heap of roads and highways named the same in different countries . but it took me aback initially when i saw Pacific Highway in your comment .. its a fantastic point of view you have achieved with your drone .. and i''m loving the mist or low lying clouds .. they really add to the appeal of this image ..   congratulations on fourth place  .. you are such an all round photographer .. nothing seems to be a challenge for you .. unintentional pun there . ;)', '2021-08-22 01:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
