(7699402, 1263111, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ammie:</b></div><hr/><i> And what a stunner of an image! Love this as all your work. We are really sorry to lose you although I think you''ll be back. Congratulations on the blue and we hope to see many more where this came from. Somewhere in the near future. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. Like I said a couple weeks ago. Im not disappearing altogether. Just staying a registered user, so only the archives  for me.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ammie: And what a stunner of an image! Love this as all your work. We are really sorry to lose you although I think you''ll be back. Congratulations on the blue and we hope to see many more where this came from. Somewhere in the near future.   Thanks. Like I said a couple weeks ago. Im not disappearing altogether. Just staying a registered user, so only the archives  for me.', '2021-08-22 06:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
