(7699409, 1263426, 3306, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. I agree with Tim that the expression of the mermaid somehow detracts from the image. Also the combination of real and surreal do not somehow blend well together. I cant quite put my finger on it. For instance the mermaids hair looks like a wig. I like the concept but I think it needs more work!</td>', 'I gave it a 6. I agree with Tim that the expression of the mermaid somehow detracts from the image. Also the combination of real and surreal do not somehow blend well together. I cant quite put my finger on it. For instance the mermaids hair looks like a wig. I like the concept but I think it needs more work!', '2021-08-22 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
