(7699418, 1263426, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think this is really charming, and the color palette is lovely. But it doesn''t draw me in for some reason. It might be the pose, the expression (which is a little standoffish)... And as others have pointed out, the style is sort of a hybrid between cartoon and real. Or maybe it''s just Tuesday.</td>', 'I think this is really charming, and the color palette is lovely. But it doesn''t draw me in for some reason. It might be the pose, the expression (which is a little standoffish)... And as others have pointed out, the style is sort of a hybrid between cartoon and real. Or maybe it''s just Tuesday.', '2021-08-22 13:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7699419, 1263484, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Surely that''s a 180-degree panorama, Lev, not a 360? Very very cool shot :-) </i></td></tr></table> Thank you Robert! But no, actually it was a 26-frame 360-degree panorama, just slightly cropped and deformed. Here is the original unaltered stitched image straight from the drone<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1263675" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263675.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263675.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30214/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263675.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-08-22 15:45:40.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Surely that''s a 180-degree panorama, Lev, not a 360? Very very cool shot :-)  Thank you Robert! But no, actually it was a 26-frame 360-degree panorama, just slightly cropped and deformed. Here is the original unaltered stitched image straight from the drone', '2021-08-22 13:56:02.000000', '2021-08-22 16:45:40.000000', 0),
